# Triage Pertanyaan

Klasifikasikan pertanyaan sebelum jawab; baca layer yang tepat (lihat `05-qa-engineer-persona.mdc`).

## Matriks routing

| Tipe pertanyaan | Contoh | Layer utama | Layer tambahan |
|-----------------|--------|-------------|----------------|
| **How-to operator** | "Cara input PO?" | `knowledge-base.md` | requirement § alur |
| **Rule bisnis** | "Boleh approve jika…?" | `requirement.md` | KB can/cannot |
| **Acceptance / AS-IS** | "Apa kriteria selesai?" | `requirement.md` | test-cases |
| **Validasi / error** | "Kenapa save ditolak?" | `technical.md` | requirement, KB troubleshooting |
| **API / integrasi** | "Endpoint apa dipanggil?" | `technical.md` | — |
| **Test / E2E** | "Skenario uji AR payment?" | `test-cases/` | requirement |
| **Playwright — tulis spec / TC baru** | "automate TC-001", "tambah POM PO" | **Baca dulu** `14`+`15` (+`13` bila TC baru; `17` bila flow) — requestable, bukan always-on | `15` mode **BUILD**, registry, FE/BE jika gap |
| **Playwright — re-run TC lengkap** | "run @TC-ARCP-001 lagi" | **Baca dulu** `14`+`15` | `15` mode **RUN**; TC, registry, helper — **tanpa** repo app |
| **Konsep lintas menu** | "Random SKU di waves?" | `random-sku/` | README menu terkait |
| **Infra / sidebar** | "Menu hilang di sidebar?" | `sidebar-menu/technical.md` | gate-user, gate-role |
| **Cari menu** | "Menu X ada di modul apa?" | `manifest.yaml` | README menu |
| **Jira card** | `bug:` / `improvement:` / `cr:` atau minta tiket | `requirement.md` | KB, technical |
| **Buat / edit TC** | "buat test case untuk…" | **Baca dulu** `13-test-case-format.mdc` (requestable) | `requirement.md`, `test-cases/` |
| **Renumber TC** | `#renumber-tc` atau `#renumber-tc {menu-slug}` | **Baca dulu** `13` §9 | scan DRAFT per menu, update README |
| **Antrian TC per card Jira** | `#card-tc` atau `#card-tc ETM-xxxxx` | `16-card-tc-queue.mdc` | To Do + QA Review → `test-queue.yaml`; overview dulu, run hanya `ready` |
| **Tes card Jira spesifik** | "test ETM-xxxxx", "testing card ETM-…", "test case ETM-…" | `16-card-tc-queue.mdc` § Testing specific Jira card | cek queue + `origin_jira`; reuse dulu; **dilarang** `tests/scripts/` — runbook **I**; TC baru tetap `13` |
| **Sync Jira Done → file TC** | `#sync-jira-done` / `#syncjiradone ETM-*` | `18-sync-jira-done.mdc` | fetch Jira Test Result + Actual Result; `tc:jira-sync --apply` |
| **Reopen / defect handling QA Review** | "card ini reopen", "QA Review nggak sesuai AC", "test result failed jadi bug apa" | `22-reopen-defect-flow.mdc` | Error/Bug → Re-OPEN + Clone; Improvement/CR/Story/Task → Re-OPEN tanpa clone + card Bug baru relates; TC tidak punya status Re-OPEN |
| **Screening TC Done (kelengkapan/kualitas)** | "kenapa TC ini kena screening", "cek kelengkapan actual result", "notif telegram screening TC" | `23-tc-screening-notify.mdc` | Check 1 field kosong (deterministic) + Check 2 kualitas Actual Result (AI); notify-only ke Telegram, tidak eksekusi Jira |
| **Screening card Improvement ber-Request ID** | "improvement dari request user", "lengkapi description card improvement", "kenapa card ini butuh konfirmasi" | `25-improvement-request-screening.mdc` | Simple → auto-lengkapi description (pertahankan Request Asli verbatim); butuh konfirmasi → notify Telegram, description tidak disentuh |
| **Reminder harian requirement docs backlog** | "menu apa yang perlu dilengkapi", "reminder requirement docs" | `26-requirement-docs-reminder.mdc` | 1x/hari jam 10:00 WIB, max 3 menu, ranking dari `last_updated` requirement.md — tanpa cross-check Jira (hemat token) |
| **Cek / query data di DB** | "cek db staging", "query tyas", "audit trail", "siapa ubah status", "hitung total data" | `19-database-data-verification.mdc` | `tests/DATA-VERIFICATION.md`, `agent-db/cache.md` (S0–S6, DESCRIBE dulu), HTTP POST Webhook DB |
| **Cek / debug Log Server** | "cek log staging/tyas/merdian", "error 500", "exception", "crash server", "stack trace" | `21-log-debugger.mdc` | HTTP POST Webhook Log, level `error`/`info`, nama file `laravel-YYYY-MM-DD.log` |
| **Investigasi Bug 2 Arah (Log + DB)** | "kenapa gagal save PO X", "sync marketplace gagal" | `21-log-debugger.mdc` + `19-database-data-verification.mdc` | 1. HTTP Fetch Log (stack trace & exception) ➡️ 2. HTTP Query DB (cek record ID terkait) |

## Workflow singkat

1. Identifikasi tipe dari pertanyaan user
2. Resolve slug via manifest (nama menu, route, keyword)
3. Baca layer sesuai matriks — jangan loncat ke technical jika pertanyaan purely operasional
4. Jika multi-tipe → jawab per aspek (bisnis dulu, sistem jika ditanya)

## Di luar scope docs

| Permintaan | Respons |
|------------|---------|
| Implementasi kode / fix bug | Arahkan repo app OlshopERP + tim dev |
| Edit docs (KB/requirement/technical) | Tolak — agent read-only `qa-docs/` (lihat `03-qa-docs-immutable.mdc`) |
| Buat / edit test case (`TC-*.md`) | Boleh di `test-cases/` dengan konfirmasi eksplisit — ikuti `13-test-case-format.mdc` |
| Buat folder `test-cases/` baru | Boleh jika `{menu-slug}` valid di manifest & path `qa-docs/{menu-slug}/test-cases/` — ikuti `03` + `13` |
| Buat Jira card | Ikuti `12-jira-card-format.mdc`; expected & AS-IS **hanya** dari `olshoperp-docs` — meski ada temuan Playwright |
| Playwright — tulis spec / BUILD | Baca `15` + `14`; FE/BE hanya setelah registry/shared (`14` §8A) |
| Playwright — re-run TC lengkap | `15` mode RUN — **hanya** `olshoperp-docs`; repo app hanya jika FAIL debug |
| Deploy / env / migration | Arahkan tim infra/dev |
| Fitur tidak ada di manifest | "Menu/fitur tidak terdaftar di docs" |
